{"pageid":3482,"title":"Version 1.35.0","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Version 1.35.0</span>","revid":15619,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.35.0\">Version 1.35.0</span></h2>\n<p><b>August 9th, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Added:\">Added:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Added new dialogue UI to all the NPCs!</li>\n<li>Added the new planker machine</li>\n<li>Added rough planks</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Changes:\">Changes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Changed coloring of UI elements</li>\n<li>Updated branding of Typical Developers</li>\n<li>Rewrote schematic behavior from scratch, <a href=\"/wiki/Schematics\" title=\"Schematics\">schematics</a> should be 2x more performant</li>\n<li>Flashlight now functions better on characters</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Schematics\" title=\"Schematics\">Schematics</a> now require trust from each user to be filled</li>\n<li>Tools can no longer be picked up if they are anchored</li>\n<li>Buffed <a href=\"/wiki/Rusty_Pickaxe\" title=\"Rusty Pickaxe\">Rusty Pickaxe</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bug_Fixes:\">Bug Fixes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Fixed vehicles jittering</li>\n<li>Fixed trailers weighing down vehicles heavily</li>\n<li>Fixed the <a href=\"/wiki/Joop_Grand_Barrow\" title=\"Joop Grand Barrow\">Joop Grand Barrow</a> spinning out</li>\n<li>Other misc. bug fixes we forgot to note down</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163738\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.012 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 14/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclus